---
import reading from '../data/prediction-backtesting-reading.json';
import {forecastMetrics,presetRows} from '../lib/forecast-calibration.mjs';
const {lab}=reading;const initial=forecastMetrics(presetRows(lab.dataset.rows,lab.presets[1]));
const label=(i:number)=>['[0, 0.2)','[0.2, 0.4)','[0.4, 0.6)','[0.6, 0.8)','[0.8, 1]'][i];
---
<div class="calibration-example" id="calibration-example" data-calibration data-example={JSON.stringify({rows:lab.dataset.rows,presets:lab.presets})}>
 <p class="eyebrow">{lab.subtitle}</p><h4>{lab.title}</h4><p>{lab.disclaimer}</p>
 <fieldset><legend>Choose a fictional forecaster</legend><div class="calibration-presets">{lab.presets.map(p=><button type="button" data-preset={p.id} aria-pressed={p.id==='matched'} disabled>{p.label}</button>)}</div></fieldset>
 <label>Change fictional outcome S01<select data-first-outcome disabled><option value="1" selected>Yes (1)</option><option value="0">No (0)</option></select></label>
 <button type="button" data-calibration-reset disabled>Reset synthetic example</button>
 <p data-explanation>{lab.presets[1].explanation}</p>
 <output data-calibration-result aria-live="polite">Mean Brier loss 0.1600 (lower is better). Binned ECE 0.0000 probability units (0.00 percentage points). n = 20; Yes = 10.</output>
 <figure><svg viewBox="0 0 320 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="calibration-chart-title calibration-chart-desc"><title id="calibration-chart-title">Observed sample calibration</title><desc id="calibration-chart-desc">Mean predicted probability on the horizontal axis, observed Yes rate on the vertical axis. Both range from zero to one. Counts and exact values appear in the table below.</desc><path d="M45 25V255H275 M45 255L275 25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="38" y="273">0</text><text x="270" y="273">1</text><text x="25" y="30">1</text><text x="82" y="294">Mean forecast →</text><text transform="translate(15 225) rotate(-90)">Observed Yes rate →</text><g data-calibration-points>{initial.bins.filter(b=>b.count).map(b=><g><circle cx={45+b.mean*230} cy={255-b.observed*230} r="6" fill="#8566ad" stroke="currentColor"/><text x={53+b.mean*230} y={249-b.observed*230}>n={b.count}</text></g>)}</g></svg><figcaption>Observed calibration in 20 fictional events. The diagonal is agreement, not a confidence interval. Zero sample ECE does not establish durable skill.</figcaption></figure>
 <div class="calibration-table"><table><caption>Five equal-width probability-of-Yes bins; empty bins have no observed rate</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Bin</th><th scope="col">Count</th><th scope="col">Mean forecast</th><th scope="col">Observed Yes</th><th scope="col">Absolute gap</th></tr></thead><tbody data-calibration-bins>{initial.bins.map(b=><tr><th scope="row">{label(b.index)}</th><td>{b.count}</td><td>{b.mean===null?'—':b.mean.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{b.observed===null?'—':b.observed.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{b.gap===null?'—':b.gap.toFixed(4)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
 <p class="formula">ECE = Σ (bin count / n) × |mean forecast − observed Yes rate|. Lower is closer agreement in this sample. No invented uncertainty intervals; no fees, execution or return estimates.</p><p><a href="#backtesting-reading">Read the evaluation methods and Mantic study limits ↓</a></p><noscript><p>The default 20% / 80% example is shown above. Interactive presets require JavaScript; the source reading is fully available.</p></noscript>
</div>
<script>import '../scripts/forecast-calibration-client.mjs';</script>
<style>
.calibration-example{border-top:1px solid #b5a9d1;margin-top:1.5rem;padding-top:1.5rem}.calibration-example h4{font-size:1.3rem}.calibration-example fieldset{padding:0;border:0;margin-block:1rem}.calibration-presets{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-top:.6rem}.calibration-presets button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#312754;color:#fffaf0}.calibration-example button,.calibration-example select{min-height:44px}.calibration-example label{display:block;margin-block:1rem}.calibration-example select{display:block;width:100%;max-width:20rem}.calibration-example svg{width:100%;max-width:23rem;overflow:visible}.calibration-example svg text{font:11px monospace;fill:currentColor}.calibration-example figure{margin:1.5rem 0}.calibration-example figcaption{font-size:.9rem}.calibration-table{overflow-x:auto}.calibration-example table{width:100%;font-size:.85rem;border-collapse:collapse}.calibration-example th,.calibration-example td{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid #b5a9d1}.calibration-example caption{text-align:left;margin-bottom:.6rem}.calibration-example :is(button,select,a):focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8566ad;outline-offset:4px}
</style>
